WEBVTT

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.950
I want some deep-fried li'l horsies!

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:11.410
Ms. Kotani...

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:12.910
You scared us.

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.660
What brought that up?

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:19.580
They're in season now, right?
I just remembered I haven't had any yet.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.080
Yer just gonna drink beer again, aren't ya?

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.450
Not happenin'.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:26.120
I won't drink in the club room again!

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:29.410
Actually, I can't buy any more,
even if I wanted to.

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:34.410
As you can see, my funds have
run dry as the Sahara Desert.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:37.660
I can't even buy dinner right now.

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:40.000
Let's all have a li'l horsies party!

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.870
Hey, those salted rice crackers are good.

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:43.870
You want some?

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:45.540
--Wait, really? But I feel like I'm imposing.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.370
--Seriously, this failure of a teacher...
--Wait, really? But I feel like I'm imposing.

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:54.200
We don't mind fishin' up some horsies,
but preppin' them later is a lot of work.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:57.870
Please! I beg of you!

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:00.540
Preppin', huh?

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:06.870
All right, we'll do it.

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:10.000
Yes! I've secured my dinner!

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.870
What was that just now?

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:15.410
But only if ya promise
not to drink beer in here.

00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:17.000
Okay!

00:02:50.910 --> 00:02:53.500
This feels great!

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:59.450
Honestly... Your president
should respect their elders more.

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:03.000
We're out of scatter bait.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.830
I need you to go to Takohigeya
and buy some krill and panko.

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:09.830
Get five small packs of krill
and three kilograms of panko.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:13.660
Natsumi and Tsurugi, go with her and
pay for everything with our club funds.

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:16.700
And don't forget the receipt.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:20.120
So what's Takohigeya?

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:22.040
It's our local fishing supply store.

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:24.330
So it's not the huge place
we went to last time?

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:29.330
That one's far away,
so we get our usual stuff at Takohigeya.

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:30.580
I see.

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:38.080
"Takohigeya"

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:39.080
"Takohigeya"
Hup.

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:40.000
"We have all kinds of lures"
Hup.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.620
"We have all kinds of lures"
It's sorta cute.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:45.080
"We have all kinds of lures"
Hina, don't be too surprised
when you see the owner.

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:46.410
"We have all kinds of lures"
Huh?

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:47.700
"We have all kinds of lures"

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.790
Heya.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:56.450
Oh, it's just you, Natsumi.

00:03:56.450 --> 00:03:59.660
Is that any way to greet your customer?

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:05.000
I couldn't tell who you were at first.
That uniform looks good on you.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.160
They do say that fine
feathers make fine birds.

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:09.450
Oh, shut up.

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:12.330
He looks like an octopus with a mustache...

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:15.790
I don't think I've seen you around before.
You must be one of Natsumi's friends.

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:17.580
Oh, and Ms. Kotani's here, too.

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:18.950
Hello.

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:21.080
So this must be for the Breakwater Club.

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:22.450
Yup.

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:26.620
I'm Hina Tsurugi, a first-year
in the Breakwater Club.

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:28.870
I'm the owner of the Takohigeya, Akai.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:30.540
You just start fishing?

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:31.910
Y-Yes...

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:35.330
I see. Well, you can ask me
anything about it anytime.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.660
I'll be happy to teach you.

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:38.830
O-Okay...

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:43.040
Wow, it looks just like him.

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:46.200
Is there a fly on my head?

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:47.540
No!

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:49.620
Go ahead! Touch it!

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:54.330
Some of my hair might grow back
if a cute girl like ya touched it.

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:55.910
I-I'm sorry!

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:57.580
You dirty old man.

00:04:57.580 --> 00:04:58.200
"Panko"
You dirty old man.

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:00.870
"Panko"

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:01.580
Okay.

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:02.040
"Takohigeya"
Okay.

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:04.040
"Takohigeya"
All right, hop in. We're heading back.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:05.580
"Takohigeya"
Okay.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.870
Thanks!

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:12.910
Did that surprise you?

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:18.120
It didn't surprise me, but I guess I know
where the shop's name comes from now.

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:25.830
We bought the things you needed, President.

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:27.080
Good work.

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:30.330
Thanks. We're ready, too.

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:40.370
It's the perfect fishing weather
today! I'm gonna catch lots!

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:42.750
Ya seem all motivated, Tsurugi.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:45.500
I'm gonna catch some on all my hooks today!

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:48.750
Hopefully your rig doesn't
get all tangled before that.

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:58.160
Huh?

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:02.750
The rig seems a bit different this time...

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:06.370
Last time, the chum basket was on
top. This time, it's on the bottom.

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:07.750
Ah...

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:10.370
All right! Let's get fishing!

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:59.410
That's decent for under two hours.

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:00.830
Yeah, we caught a lot.

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:02.620
There's probably around 300.

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:04.200
They look so good.

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:06.330
I'm getting hungry.

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:09.200
Let's fry them all up and eat!

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:12.330
We need to prep them first.

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:16.250
Tsurugi, I'll show ya how to gut the fish.

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:17.120
Huh?!

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:22.290
We made Ohno do it last time,
but ya need to learn how to do it, too.

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:25.620
Wait, then that...

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:28.450
That's what that meant...

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:31.580
The more ya touch them,
the more you'll get used to them.

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:34.660
Soon, you'll be able to fillet flatheads, too.

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:37.450
Ya want to get over yer
fear of animals, don't ya?

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:40.950
That means ya need to challenge yerself.

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:46.500
Wouldn't it be cool to be like
Ohno who can do everything herself?

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:50.200
When ya catch, fillet, and
cook yer own fish, it's the best.

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:52.830
Not to mention, guys love girls like Ohno.

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:56.200
You'll be a fine bride someday.

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.580
Senpai, wait! You're gonna break it!

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:02.250
Ya don't wanna be past yer prime
like someone else here, do ya?

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:06.200
I can hear you! And I'm still
somewhat in my twenties!

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:08.450
O-Okay.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:13.910
I'll do my best so I don't end up like
Ms. Kotani who eats other people's food!

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:17.330
Yeah, I guess you're still mad
about the Asian hard clam.

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.080
S-Sorry about that.

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:21.080
"Kumamoto Prefectural Route"

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:26.620
Okay, I'll show you how
to do it, so watch carefully.

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.620
Uh, okay.

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:31.620
Wait, you're not going to use a knife?

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:38.160
Nope. You go like this and detach the gills...

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:43.830
Hold it right above the pectoral fin,
and then if you just pull down...

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.910
You can easily pull out its guts.

00:08:45.910 --> 00:08:53.950
Then you cut down to its belly and once
you've washed away the rest of the guts...

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:55.540
You're all done.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:00.160
Here you go. I know you can do it.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:05.330
Right, I just remembered my mom
asked me to buy some things for dinner

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:07.450
so I should get going...

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:11.370
Then ya can bring back
some deep-fried horsies.

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:13.330
Don't be so lame, Hina.

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:15.750
Ya just said ya'd do your best.

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:18.750
Ya don't want to end up
like a certain someone, do ya?

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:23.580
Stop looking over here!
Come on, you've got this!

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:29.870
The gills feel so...

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:31.950
Just get it over with.

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:40.580
I-I can't...

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:43.370
Oh, fine.

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:46.120
I'll pull it off with you.

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:49.450
W-Wait! L-Let's do it on
the count of three, then!

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:52.950
Okay, fine. Hold on tight!

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:55.580
One, two!

00:09:58.540 --> 00:09:59.580
See? You did it.

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:00.580
--You monster!

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:01.450
--That looks like fun.
--You monster!

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:02.450
--That looks like fun.
--No monster's as cute as me!

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:03.450
--Ya know, ya can help, too.
--No monster's as cute as me!

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:05.200
--Ya know, ya can help, too.
--Stop complimenting yourself!
And let go of me already! Please!

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:08.120
--It's my job to watch over you girls.
--Stop complimenting yourself!
And let go of me already! Please!

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:09.790
Ya better hurry up, or we'll never be done.

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:15.450
Oh, okay...

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:18.040
Ohno-<i>senpai</i>'s amazing.

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:21.700
I guess it's a lot of work to
eat something that was living.

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:24.700
Ohno-<i>senpai</i>, I'm surprised
you're not affected by this.

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:27.620
It doesn't gross you out?

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:32.500
I think I'm just used to it.
But it is pretty gross.

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:34.250
Really?

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:39.370
This is necessary to eat them, so I just
do this without thinking about it much.

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:40.910
Without thinking about it...

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:45.500
Don't think of it as living. Think of it
as one of the plushies ya like so much

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:48.250
and yer just takin' the
stuffin' out... or somethin'.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:52.160
A plushie? I see...

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:55.700
This is a li'l horsey plushie that I made.

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:59.040
It's just really well made.

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:02.620
It's just a felt plushie that
looks extremely realistic.

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:06.660
I just need to detach the gills
and pull out the stuffing.

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:10.450
Just detach the gills
and pull out the stuffing.

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:21.160
Just detach the gills
and pull out the stuffing.

