00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:41.410
Gills. Stuffing.

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:44.080
--Earth to Hina!
--Gills. Stuffing.

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:45.450
Hina!

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:49.450
