00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:41.450
Oh, fine.

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:48.200
Well, I've basically mastered
<i>sabiki </i>fishing, so I'll go catch lots.

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:52.450
I can even gut them and
prep them now... I think.

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:54.290
You just go pop!

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:57.500
Wow, ya grew so much.

00:13:58.910 --> 00:14:00.870
Well, we'll look forward to it.

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:03.040
Leave it to me!

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:06.250
Guess I'll get back to work.

00:14:06.250 --> 00:14:07.790
Let's see...

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:10.870
I wonder which fishing rod I should use.

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:13.540
There're so many.
I don't know which one to pick.

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:16.450
I'm sure they all work,
so I guess I'll pick whatever.

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:18.200
This one's short, so I'll just use this.

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:18.410
"For baby horse mackerels"

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:20.580
"For baby horse mackerels"
