00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:32.080
Don't worry. I already have one.

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:34.160
Thanks for yer business.

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:36.040
Make sure ya catch lots of them.

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:37.450
I will.

